{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Before we finalize the remote instruction day plan, I need to raise an important family access concern. My family outreach confirmations from this week identified 38 households that lack reliable internet access. The current draft plan assumes families can use digital materials, but these households will need printed learning packets and bilingual phone check-ins in Spanish and Somali. I'd like to make sure we address this gap before Dr. Lee signs off on the plan."}
```

