{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "Good morning, Dr. Lee and team. I need to share a critical update from IT. District learning-management-system authentication will be offline for scheduled maintenance from 8:00 to 11:00 a.m. tomorrow. I confirmed the maintenance window with the vendor today, but the vendor notice has not yet been attached to the remote-day draft. This means the draft plan's approach of scheduling instruction through the LMS beginning at 8:00 a.m. will not work — students and teachers will not be able to log in during that window. Instead, instructional files must be distributed by email as downloadable PDFs and made available for printing by 7:30 a.m. We need to revise the instructional delivery portion of the plan to reflect email-based PDF distribution before approval."}
```

